               <msContents>
                  <summary>Folios i and 13 are blank front and end leaves, new white paper. Penciled pagination starting with page number 3 on fol. 1r and ending with page number 26 on fol. 12v.</summary>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i0">
                     <locus from="1v" to="12v">1v-12v</locus>
                     <textLang xml:lang="ar">Arabic</textLang>
                     <title ref="LIT0049IHA#s31IHA"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>فَمَنْ اَظْلَمُ مِمَّنْ كَذَبَ عَلَي اللهِ وِكَذَّبَ بِّالصِّدْقِ</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#12v">-12v</locus>وَمَا رَبُّكَ بِظَلَّامٍ لِّلْعَبِيْدِ , اِليه<note>The last word on the line is the first word of ǧuz' 25.</note>
                     </explicit>
                     <note>39:32-41:46. Some words completed on the following line. Diacritic of ḏāl frequently placed outside / the upper part of the stroke. Red circles or dots as verse markers. Catchwords written using another ink, probably by another hand.</note>
                     <note/>
